# O NetworkManager nunca mexe no cabo USB (gadget RNDIS, 172.16.42.1). O modem (ttyC0,
# ccmni*) e dele: dados moveis pelo ModemManager (plugin mtk-ccci). Reforco do
# unmanaged-devices de /usr/lib/NetworkManager/conf.d/5*-thunder*.conf.
SUBSYSTEM=="net", ACTION!="remove", KERNEL=="rndis*|usb*", ENV{NM_UNMANAGED}="1"
